OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers lied about
OL,4,Asearches connected to fatal crash,
OL,5,Ahearing told
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo police officers lied about carrying
OL,8,Fout missing person searches at the
OL,9,Fhomes of two young women who were
OL,10,Finvolved in a triple fatal crash, a
OL,11,Fpolice misconduct hearing has heard.
OL,13,FPC Richard Hardwick and PC Lauren
OL,14,FLivingstone face gross misconduct
OL,15,Fallegations over their actions before a
OL,16,Fcar carrying five people was found
OL,17,Fcrashed two days later in a woodland in
OL,18,FSt Mellons, Cardiff, in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
