OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers lied about
OL,4,Asearches connected to fatal crash,
OL,5,Ahearing told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe hearing in Newport was told they
OL,8,Fwere "dishonest" in official logs and
OL,9,Fto a senior officer by claiming
OL,10,Fsearches of the homes of Eve Smith, who
OL,11,Fdied, and Sophie Russon had been
OL,12,Fcarried out.
OL,14,FThe two serving Gwent officers attended
OL,15,Fthe hearing and denied all allegations
OL,16,Fagainst them.
